OL,3,AVeterans who died by suicide honoured
OL,4,Aat memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdward Mackenzie, co-founder of the
OL,7,FElysium Memorial Foundation, which is
OL,8,Fbehind the project, said he was "blown
OL,9,Faway" by the number of people that had
OL,10,Fturned up.
